APP_REBUILD_RESULT {"operation":"scenario","status":"unavailable","reason":"Unobserved post-lesson path; inspect current UI","onboarding":[{"stage":0,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"Hi there! I’m Duo!\nHi there! I’m Duo!\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":1,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"Let’s get this party started!\nLet’s get this party started!\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":2,"selected_group":"hdyhau","visible_text":"How did you hear about Duolingo?\nHow did you hear about Duolingo?\nTV\nTikTok\nFriends/family\nBrawl Stars\nShopee\nNews/article/blog\nYouTube\nGoogle Search\nFacebook/Instagram\nOther\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":3,"selected_group":"motivation","visible_text":"Any reason is a good reason to learn!\nAny reason is a good reason to learn!\nPrepare for travel\nSupport my education\nJust for fun\nSpend time productively\nBoost my career\nConnect with people\nOther\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":4,"selected_group":"proficiency","visible_text":"How much Spanish do you know?\nHow much Spanish do you know?\nI’m new to Spanish\nI know some common words\nI can have basic conversations\nI can talk about various topics\nI can discuss most topics in detail\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":5,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"Here’s what you can achieve!\nHere’s what you can achieve!\nConverse with confidence\nStress-free speaking and listening exercises\nBuild a large vocabulary\nCommon words and practical phrases\nDevelop a learning habit\nSmart reminders, fun challenges, and more\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":6,"selected_group":"daily-goal","visible_text":"That’s 25 words in your first week!\nThat’s 25 words in your first week!\n5 min / day\nCasual\n10 min / day\nRegular\n15 min / day\nSerious\n20 min / day\nIntense\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":7,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"I’ll remind you to practice so it becomes a habit!\nI’ll remind you to practice so it becomes a habit!\nwww.duolingo.com wants to\nShow notifications\nBLOCK\nALLOW\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":8,"selected_group":"choose-path","visible_text":